ReadMe File for JAZZPOP.ZIP
These are Jazz and Pop songs found on various BBS'S.They are in
Band-in-a-Box (version 5 ) song file format. You need Band-in-a-Box
to run these files.
The  JAZZPOP.ZIP songs are mainly Jazz standards with some pop songs.
You'll need PKUnzip to Unzip these files (IBM).
Keep uploading your songs !!

